# i18n keys

Always snake_case: `[domain]_[entity]_[context]_[modifier]`, all lowercase words joined by `_`.

Examples: `facility_mgmt`, `facility_name`, `announcement_created`, `edit_pricing_rule`, `*_descr`, `platform_line_assistant_record_unsure`.

Update all locales (`en`, `tw`, `jp`); no camelCase or PascalCase keys; no generic `name` when a prefixed key exists. Older mixed-case keys (`Facility_Name`) stay until their feature is touched; new keys are snake_case.
